From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ps5cemu <ps5cemu@localhost>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:58:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] PS5: the Graphics pack starts on High (200%) shadows; built,
 untested on console

The Shadows preset a fresh launcher selects is High, $shadowRes = 2, so the near cascade's 768x720 map becomes 1536x1440 and its 2x2 PCF taps cover 4 times the texels. A saved choice wins: the preset names are unchanged, so Low, Medium, Ultra and Extreme keep applying as before. The community copy ships the same default.
---
 resources/BreathOfTheWild_Graphics/rules.txt              | 2 +-
 resources/graphicPacks/BreathOfTheWild/Graphics/rules.txt | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/resources/BreathOfTheWild_Graphics/rules.txt b/resources/BreathOfTheWild_Graphics/rules.txt
index c8cd452..ae07a3b 100644
--- a/resources/BreathOfTheWild_Graphics/rules.txt
+++ b/resources/BreathOfTheWild_Graphics/rules.txt
@@ -220,12 +220,12 @@ $shadowRes = 0.5
 
 [Preset]
 name = Medium (100%, Default)
-default = 1
 category = Shadows
 condition = $qualityPreset > 0
 
 [Preset]
 name = High (200%)
+default = 1
 category = Shadows
 condition = $qualityPreset > 0
 $shadowRes = 2
diff --git a/resources/graphicPacks/BreathOfTheWild/Graphics/rules.txt b/resources/graphicPacks/BreathOfTheWild/Graphics/rules.txt
index 80e6ce1..90439a3 100644
--- a/resources/graphicPacks/BreathOfTheWild/Graphics/rules.txt
+++ b/resources/graphicPacks/BreathOfTheWild/Graphics/rules.txt
@@ -546,11 +546,11 @@ $shadowRes = 0.5
 
 [Preset]
 name = Medium (100%, Default)
-default = 1
 category = Shadows
 
 [Preset]
 name = High (200%)
+default = 1
 category = Shadows
 $shadowRes = 2
 
